# M2, member a (k10): with b through the lobby gate and stag0101's matz00 into dng101b1, then the map recorder there
# (n_recorderdng#0 behind g_d1door#0, which GENE-03's wave opens: flag 102; its talk window and the floor map
# j_map101b1) while b walks about.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
explore matz00 yes until stage=dng101b1,control
log in the dungeon
fight -180 20 90 until flag:102>=1 or frames>=6000 fail stagechange,dead,frames>=5990
log the door to the map recorder is open
talkto n_recorderdng#0 until talking=1 or frames>=3000 fail stagechange,dead,frames>=2990
log a reads the map recorder
idle until frames>=150 fail stagechange,talking=0
shot a_map
talkto n_recorderdng#0 until talking=0,frames>=60 fail stagechange
log a read the map recorder
idle until frames>=120
shot a_map_after
idle until frames>=300
